  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4be51c5168caa0d42bd51f33c68daba8, type: 3}
  m_Name: General's Findings
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LetterData
  letterTitle: 
  pages:
  - We have confirmation of internal sabotage patterns. Howls has reported confession
    of drunken fool and with it brought the cult key as evidence. Those cultists
    are planning of a sneak attack. we must take action immediately. At the beginning
    of winter, I will authorize deployment of necessary forces to secure victory
    upon them. If Howls is true we must make haste.
  letterImage: {fileID: 0}
